      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Yes, indeed. We've been stuck on this planet since the end of the Mandalorian Wars. \n\nOur Corvette got boarded by some Mandalorian ships and we had to evacuate. Our emergency pod landed there...But the Republic has no ships around and they told us to wait for a rescue team. It's been almost 3 years now. I doubt they'll come.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
