      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "It's an honor thing, y'know? We've seen so much during the War. There isn't much left to frighten us. Nowadays, you could get killed because you are wearing a Mandalorian armor, a Jedi robe or even a Czerka uniform..You just have to walk in the wrong street. At least, with these outfits, Czerka guards keep away from us.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
